{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那之后……", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯呼、嗯呼、真、真的够了啦、很痒，而且很羞耻……”", "text_idx": 158, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6762", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们脱下衣服清理身体，然后躺到床上依偎彼此。", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我温柔地抱着纱凪，抚摸着她的头。", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──聊胜于无，倒也不是。", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然那样说，但你没有抵抗呢，纱凪。”", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 208, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为不知道是被谁弄得神魂颠倒嘛。”", "text_idx": 163, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6763", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“而且新吾看起来很想摸的样子……我是没办法才让你摸的喔♪”", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6764", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……反正很舒服，又很放松。”", "text_idx": 129, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6765", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸……好痛痛痛！”", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6766", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……纱凪、该不会……”", "text_idx": 150, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 208, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“抱歉……感觉身体好像恢复力气了，结果好像连那里都想起来……”", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6767", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……是我该说抱歉。”", "text_idx": 135, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 208, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你不用道歉没关系。就像我刚才说的，这是我们都想做的事。”", "text_idx": 140, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6768", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“女孩子的第一次会痛是自然的生理现象，没办法。”", "text_idx": 167, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6769", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……但是，如果我没有那么激烈的话。", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我无法克制自己这样想。", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "至少，在纱凪的痛楚痊愈之前，我绝对不能要求第二次……", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 127, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 208, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──不对。", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在纱凪开口要求之前我应该忍耐。我不能主动要求。", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我不能又失去理性，像野兽一样……欺负纱凪……", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所～以～啊～你不必在意。”", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6770", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果你觉得男人只负责舒服很抱歉的话，与其道歉，那个……亲……亲我吧。”", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6771", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯啾。”", "text_idx": 159, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 208, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呼嗯、嗯嗯……！？啾、啾咕、嗯嗯、啾……啾姆、嗯嗯、嗯……唔唔……♪”", "text_idx": 147, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6772", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈……太、太快了、笨蛋……嘿嘿嘿。”", "text_idx": 148, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6773", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……讨厌吗？”", "text_idx": 137, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 208, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“又说那种话……哪可能讨厌嘛，应该说──”", "text_idx": 143, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6774", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果我会那样想，那个……就、就不会把女孩子重要的东西给你了。”", "text_idx": 170, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6775", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪……嗯。”", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 208, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊、嗯、啾……嗯呼、嗯呼、又亲我了……啾咕、嗯啾、啾、啾。”", "text_idx": 151, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6776", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呼啊……嘿、嘿嘿嘿……嗯♪”", "text_idx": 146, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6777", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "嘴唇才刚分开，纱凪就笑得一脸开心，蹭了蹭我的脸。", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……刚才那样的，还要做更多更多……”", "text_idx": 128, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6778", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“可以吗……？”", "text_idx": 144, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 208, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然害羞，可是能感觉到被珍惜……”", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6779", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……嗯，请让我珍惜你。”", "text_idx": 132, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 208, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嘿嘿……今天就特别吧……♪”", "text_idx": 161, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6780", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然已经跨夜了。”", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 208, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……欸、啊、真的耶！？”", "text_idx": 136, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6781", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽、虽然我没资格说这个，不过新吾不回去没关系嘛？”", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6782", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么可能放着这么可爱的女朋友回去。”", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 208, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……哈、唔。”", "text_idx": 130, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6783", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那、那样说也、那个、很好……还要听……”", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6784", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“樱乃今天也会住在濑名同学家，所以不用在意时间没关系。”", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 208, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是、是这样啊……”", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6785", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……那、那么，干脆……那个、新吾愿意的话……”", "text_idx": 138, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6786", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“到早上……都在一起吧……？”", "text_idx": 142, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6787", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……我犹豫了一秒。", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是纱凪的眼神中散发着强烈的希望。", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果你乖乖睡觉的话。”", "text_idx": 168, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 208, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“睡睡睡！一、一起睡觉对吧！？”", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6788", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……当然。”", "text_idx": 133, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 208, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "嗯，没问题。我能忍得住。", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不会再失去理性了。", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈……居然能跟新吾一起睡觉，今天真的发生好多第一次……”", "text_idx": 149, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6789", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就说已经跨夜了。”", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 208, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不用管那种细节啦，到睡着醒来之前都算今天。”", "text_idx": 139, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6790", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为是平安夜，所以全部都是被允许的。”", "text_idx": 164, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6791", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……在纱凪心中，平安夜似乎是有魔法的样子。", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以说，想要更多、更多新吾♪”", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6792", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你根本就不想睡吧？”", "text_idx": 141, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 208, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呀！”", "text_idx": 145, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6793", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈哈……抱歉抱歉，因为纱凪太可爱了。”", "text_idx": 154, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 208, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为是平安夜，所以原谅你……♪”", "text_idx": 165, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6794", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊、好痛痛痛。”", "text_idx": 152, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6795", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……为了能尽量减缓疼痛，不管几次……我会温柔的。”", "text_idx": 155, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 208, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……嗯♪给我很多礼物吧……？”", "text_idx": 131, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6796", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然那种眼神很可爱……不过，现在闭上眼睛吧？”", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 208, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……啾、啾♪”", "text_idx": 156, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6797", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嘿嘿嘿……感觉光是今天，就超过以前加起来亲亲的次数了……♪”", "text_idx": 162, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6798", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“在各种意义上都是一辈子难忘的夜晚……嘿嘿、欸嘿嘿……”", "text_idx": 166, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6799", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……新吾呢？跟我一样……一辈子都忘不了今晚吗？”", "text_idx": 134, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6800", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么可能忘记。”", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 208, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──没错，在各种意义上今天都是让人无法忘记的一天。", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不可能忘记。", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈……太好了！把新吾迷得神魂颠倒～♪”", "text_idx": 153, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6801", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯呼、嗯优嗯优嗯优……哈～太高兴了、太幸福了……”", "text_idx": 157, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6802", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "笑着这么说的纱凪真的好可爱、好惹人怜爱。", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以我抱紧她，一次又一次地亲吻、抚摸头发取悦她。", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯嗯……♪呵呵、呵呵呵、嗯优嗯优嗯优～”", "text_idx": 160, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 211, "voice": "sn6803", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "于是纱凪的身体便亲密地贴上来，像在要求‘更多’……", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在直到天亮为止的短暂时间中，我们依偎着彼此入睡了……", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
